      "label": "R2 — Lower Bias Resistor (10kΩ)",
      "education_note": "Works with R1 to set Vb ≈ 2.14V. Emitter is ~0.65V below base, so Ve ≈ 1.49V across Re.",
      "position": { "x": -3, "y": 1, "z": 0 },
